---
manual: slot.scroll
lines: [2435, 2436]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $scrolling = stack height: 100, scroll: true do
    para "scrolls"
  end
  $plain = stack { para "does not" }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal true, $scrolling.scroll, "a slot made with scroll: true may show a scrollbar"
refute $plain.scroll, "a plain slot may not"
